# FakeSap requests. Run FakeSap (standalone or via the AppHost) and send them from VS Code / Rider / Visual Studio.
@FakeSap = http://localhost:5090
@sid = PRD

### Landscape (T000 / STMS)
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/systems

### SM37: canceled jobs (status: canceled | finished | active | released)
# @name canceledJobs
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/jobs?status=canceled

### SM37: all jobs
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/jobs

### ST22: dumps of the last 24 hours
# @name dumps
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/dumps

### ST22: dumps since a point in time
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/dumps?since=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z

### ST22: dump detail
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/dumps/{{dumps.response.body.$[0].DUMPID}}

### SU01: locked users
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/users/locked

### STMS: import queue
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/transports/queue

### STRUST: certificates
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/certificates

### SM50: work processes
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/workprocesses

### BAPI_USER_UNLOCK
POST {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/users/MEHMET/unlock

### SM37 repeat scheduling: restart the first canceled job
POST {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/jobs/{{canceledJobs.response.body.$[0].JOBNAME}}/{{canceledJobs.response.body.$[0].JOBCOUNT}}/restart

### STMS import (replace TRKORR with one from the import queue)
POST {{FakeSap}}/sap/{{sid}}/transports/DEVK900100/import

### Unknown system -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{FakeSap}}/sap/XYZ/jobs
